Carrying-table effects (carrying capacity, mining, shooting accuracy, work speed, medicine, social, etc.) take the same power of the multiple per +2 ability: 100% about ×1.32 (×4 per +10), 50% about ×1.15, 10% about ×1.03.

Multiplies with "ability effect strength" above; doesn't change ability values, caps, feat requirements or saves. Beasts' wild levels are unaffected.
